  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One signal, four sources",
      "items": [
        "Pointer, gyroscope, camera hand or camera face \u2014 consumers never know which is live",
        "The value lives in a ref, not React state",
        "At 60 fps, state would mean 60 re-renders of the whole hero every second"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "The privacy panel has to be true",
      "items": [
        "The MediaPipe WASM and both models are served from /mediapipe/ on this origin",
        "Not from the jsdelivr CDN that MediaPipe reaches for by default",
        "If they came from outside, the panel that reads '0 network requests' would be a lie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two gates on the build",
      "items": [
        "Prebuild fails if a project card has no section in llms.txt \u2014 the link would lead nowhere",
        "Postbuild measures the home page's gzip JS against a recorded baseline",
        "And proves three.js and the face model are still lazy: a stray static import drags them in silently"
      ]
    }
  ]
